              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tasha"
            },
            "reviewBody": "best I've found so far, ran out of triple sec though... Also I used regular vodka because I also like traditional martini's, but I imagine I'd like it better with the citron. i used gran gala which is compared to grand marnier, although I've never had the fancy stuff so i cant say which is better. the rest the kept the same. thanks for the recipe the amounts were perfect and also easy to remember which makes me happy :)"
          },
