              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nelda Jo Speed"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had a bottle of my favorite vodka in the freezer and cranberry juice begging to be make into something good to drink! I added about 1/2 oz. of fresh lime juice since I was using plain vodka. It was awesome! Best I have ever had!",
